<title>NORWAY: FORECAST - Orkla 8-month result seen slightly higher.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Orkla 8-month result seen slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian food-based conglomerate Orkla ASA is expected to present an eight-month result before tax of 1.53 billion crowns, according to eight analysts polled by Reuters.</p>
<p>Of 10 analysts asked for a stock recommendation, six said buy Orla shares and four said hold.</p>
<p>Orkla will announce the eight-month result on Thursday.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Average    high   low     8-mnth 1995</p>
<p> Operating income	     16,789   17,321   16,381   13,250</p>
<p> Operating result		1,225    1,245    1,175    1,155</p>
<p> Net financial items	    -329     -277     -405     -218</p>
<p> Gains on securities	     496	540	421	358</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		  1,528    1,589    1,465     1,407</p>
<p> Result after tax		1,063    1,102    1,016    1,061</p>
<p> EPS 1996 (9 analysts,crowns) 31.1     33.0     27.5</p>
<p> EPS 1997 (9 analysts)	  33.5     36.0     30.5</p>
<p> EPS 1998 (7 analysts)	  36.7     38.6     34.1</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
